     \end{equation*}
     Then the linear operator $\mathbf{K}$ associated with $K$ is identical to the operator $\mathbf{C}_{2r}[\mathcal{X},\mu,\lambda]$ on $\mathbb{R}[\mathbf{x}]_{2r}$.

\begin{equation*}
