Recall that $K(\mathbf{x},\mathbf{x}_j)= \prod_{i=1}^mC_{2r}[\mathcal{X}_i,\mu_i,\lambda^{(i)}](\mathbf{x}^{(i)},\mathbf{x}^{(i)}_j)$. Lemma~\ref{lemma: recall results} gives $\lambda^{(i)}$'s satisfying that
