 \end{displaymath}
 Therefore, $K(\mathbf{x},\mathbf{x}_j) = \prod_{i=1}^mC_{2r}[\mathcal{X}_i,\mu_i,\lambda^{(i)}](\mathbf{x}^{(i)},\mathbf{x}^{(i)}_j) \in \mathcal{T}(\mathcal{X})_{2mr}$.
