        \leq\; & \left(\sum_{j_1+\dots+j_m  \leq k}\sum_{i=1}^m\left|1-\lambda^{(i)}_{j_i}\right|\right) \Lambda(\mathcal{X},k)\|f\|_{\mathcal{X}}
