\label{cor: convergence rate for compact semi-algebraic set}
     Let $\mathcal{X}$ be the set and $k,r$ be the numbers defined as in Theorem~\ref{thm: error on general}. Then the following inequality holds:
     \begin{multline*}
          f_{\min}-\mathrm{lb}(f,\mathcal{R}(\mathcal{X}))_r \leq \Biggl[\Gamma(\mathbb{B}_R \times \Delta_K^m,k)2\gamma(n+m,R+mK^2,k)\dfrac{(2d)^2}{(r-4d)^2}\\+\frac{cL(R,k)(2d)^{\textit{\L}}}{(r-4d)^{\textit{\L}}}
