         =\left \langle e_{\tau},\, \varphi_{2r}\left((A\mathbf{x})^{\alpha+\beta}\cdot 
         (g_J \circ A^{-1}) (A\mathbf{x}) \right)\right \rangle\\
         =&\; \left \langle  e_{\tau},
